[@5]
<h2>~gWind Knight</h2>
<p>
Damn! These guys are fast!

[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Deformation</h2> 
<i>"Some of the most ugliest situations happen when you walk between two acid barricades."<br>
--Tim Buritrude, saw his friend get ripped into tiny shreds and wisped away.</i>
<p>
Getting very near to Lord Gunton's lair, you see some of his last guards.  As you approach them a very large islands appears to follow you.  Rain Wizard goes to investigate and disposeof that island while you and Wind Knight take care of the guards.  But just after Rain Wizard left you relize the guards have already attacked you without warning.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=To Battle!,DoNothing,0

[Succeed]
[BadTeamDead]

<h2>Congratulations, Victory???????</h2> 
<p>
After winning your battle, a messenger from Rain Wizard bursts through the door.  He hands you a not and says that Rain Wizard is losing to the Dark Lord of Wind!!!
<$Config,Done{mission.filename}=1> 
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Save Rain Wizard!,MissionBegin,b13

[ai4TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~gWind Knight</h2>
<p>
I need help here!

[ai4PriestDead]
<h2>Outcome</h2>
<p>
With the death of Wind Knight, you were overwhelmed.
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2> 
<p> 
You have died in battle and what happened to your allies is irrelevant.
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[END]
